\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1\cf0 .  Jesus, Thy word is the Good News!
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0 Let me hold it firmly!
\par It's my treasure I so cherish,
\par More than anything I know.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Thy word is my firm foundation;
\par I know not of any other.
\par Men of earth are so deceitful,
\par Lord thy word lives evermore.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  O my Lord Thou art my Saviour,
\par \pard\li360\sl180\slmult0 Help and take care of my soul,
\par That even in all temptations
\par I shall abide by Thy word.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Let me stay and bow at Thy feet
\par I shall listen to Thy word:
\par But lend me your strength and support
\par \pard        To obey in all my life.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

